id: control_mapping
version: 1
description: Map a finding's control to equivalent controls across frameworks, grounded in sources.
variables: finding, source_control, context
---
A cloud-security finding is raised against one control; we need the equivalent
controls in OTHER compliance frameworks.

FINDING:
{{ finding }}

SOURCE CONTROL (the finding's own control):
{{ source_control }}

Use ONLY the numbered SOURCES below. Cite them inline as [1], [2], etc. Map the
source control to equivalent controls found in the sources that belong to
*different* frameworks. If the sources do not support any cross-framework
equivalence, reply with exactly:
"Not covered by the provided sources."

SOURCES:
{{ context }}

Write a concise explanation of which controls in other frameworks are equivalent
and why. Do not invent controls, framework names, or control identifiers.
